* ZLT - TEXT AND LIBRARY VIEWER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ZLT - TEXT AND LIBRARY VIEWER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:ZLT [dir:]filespec [. options]
    SYSUTLS:ZLT [dir:]library member [options]

Private library/text viewer supporting ordinary text and its compiled
compression formats. Space advances a line; other ordinary keys advance a
page; Ctrl-X moves to the next file; Ctrl-Z toggles paging; Ctrl-C exits.

Use public LT for normal caller reading. Listing or reading a library
member does not authorize executing a program from that library.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
